{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC Speedy - Supercharge Your PC in One Click!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is your computer slow or lagging during gaming sessions or daily tasks? <strong>PC Speedy</strong> is here to instantly boost your PC\u2019s performance! With just one click, it shuts down unnecessary background processes, delivering immediate results. Want more lasting effects? Activate <strong>Permanent Speed Enhancement</strong>, optimizing your PC for sustained performance. Changed your mind? Easily revert with the convenient <strong>Undo</strong> option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond boosting speed, <strong>PC Speedy</strong> keeps your computer secure by checking antivirus status, BIOS updates, and Secure Boot settings. Keep your hardware healthy with built-in monitoring tools for <strong>SMART drive status</strong> and real-time temperature readings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need even more control? Explore our suite of powerful <strong>Diagnostic Tools</strong> to dive deep into your system\u2019s performance and stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Take control. Speed up your PC today\u2014Get PC Speedy on Steam now!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843180?t=1751581380","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843180?t=1751581380","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843180/e3fc7a44b14f087bc3ec87fb7fef5a5eb6aa46ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751581380","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843180/e3fc7a44b14f087bc3ec87fb7fef5a5eb6aa46ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751581380","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC Speedy - Supercharge Your PC in One Click!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is your computer slow